# Keep LF in the working tree on every platform.
#
# Without this, a global `core.autocrlf=true` rewrites checked-out files to CRLF, and Prettier —
# whose default `endOfLine` is "lf" — then fails `pnpm run lint` on files nobody edited. That turns
# every `git checkout` into a broken quality gate, which the porting pipeline hits constantly.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
